CHAPTER.VERS:
And their border went up 

          Or, westward, toward the great sea.
         toward the sea, and Maralah, and reached to Dabbasheth, and reached to the river that [is] before Jokneam;

And Remeth, and 

          There was another city of this name in the tribe of Judah: for in various tribes certain cities had the same name, and were distinguished by the tribe only.
         Engannim, and Enhaddah, and Bethpazzez;
